  "description": {
   "en": "Naruse Luna, who entered an all-girls school dreaming of a life as a high school girl full of flowers. In middle school, she played baseball with boys and was the ace of her team, but what awaited her was not drinking tea and walking home with friends nor elegant time spent with her wonderful seniors, but rather... the handball club!?",
   "ja": "華の女子高生ライフを夢見て女子校に入学をした鳴瀬（なるせ）るな。\n\n中学では男子と一緒に野球漬け＆チームのエースだった彼女を待つのは、友達とお茶して帰る日々でも、素敵な先輩と優雅に過ごす日々でもなく…ハンドボール部だった!?"
  },
